4D-ID Specification License

The specification text in this repository (the files under parts/) is made
available for review and implementation under an open documentation license,
pending contribution to a standards body. You may read, implement, and quote it
with attribution.

The machine-readable artifacts in this repository (schemas/, openapi/,
conformance/) and all associated code are licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0:

    https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The 4D-ID identifier is self-minting and permissionless: anyone may create a
valid 4D-ID with no registry, no gatekeeper, and no fee. The working draft is
intended to be royalty-free.

